  "description": "Spec-054 FR-009 — Adversarial mismatch in component (d) settlement_evidence subset.\n\nThe ReceiptEnvelope is correctly signed (valid JWS, valid kid in JWKS, valid\ntimestamp_evidence) and declares settlement_evidence with txHash =\n'0xfeedface...0001'. At verify time the auditor is presented with\nverification_inputs.settlement_evidence.txHash = '0xdeadbeef...0002' (a\ndifferent on-chain transaction). All other subset fields (network, amount,\nasset, payTo, payer) remain identical. When the verifier recomputes\nbinding_hash using the auditor's settlement subset, component (d) does NOT\nmatch.\n\nVerifier MUST reject with typed reason 'binding_mismatch' and identify the\nmismatched component as 'settlement_evidence_subset'. The envelope signature\nstays valid — only the semantic binding to the on-chain settlement fails.",
